WEBVTT

00:02.576 --> 00:05.602
<i>It seems today that all you see</i>

00:05.712 --> 00:09.272
<i>Is violence in movies and sex on TV</i>

00:09.382 --> 00:12.648
<i>But where are those
good old-fashioned values</i>

00:12.753 --> 00:15.551
<i>On which we used to rely?</i>

00:15.989 --> 00:19.117
<i>Lucky there's a family guy</i>

00:19.226 --> 00:22.217
<i>Lucky there's a man who
positively can do</i>

00:22.461 --> 00:24.123
<i>All the things that make us</i>

00:24.231 --> 00:25.823
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:25.966 --> 00:30.699
<i>He's a family guy</i>

00:35.207 --> 00:37.437
<i>We now return to
Rodney King of Queens.</i>

00:37.811 --> 00:39.472
<i>Rodney, did you take out the trash?</i>

00:40.280 --> 00:41.338
<i>I forgot.</i>

00:43.917 --> 00:45.544
Oh, no, she didn't.

00:47.354 --> 00:48.320
Pizza for Adam West.

00:49.055 --> 00:52.719
No! You gave me Canadian bacon
instead of bacon!

00:52.893 --> 00:55.384
This misdeed cannot go unpunished.

00:55.595 --> 00:57.062
Pizza delivery man,

00:57.164 --> 00:58.597
prepare to meet your maker

00:58.765 --> 01:01.130
at the hands of my cat-launcher.

01:20.287 --> 01:23.484
Hey, look! Somebody tried to break into
the dirty-movie store.

01:23.590 --> 01:25.990
Quick! Grab as many as you can
before someone sees us.

01:28.728 --> 01:29.752
Damn, I lost him.

01:29.962 --> 01:31.657
All right cats, back in the bag.

01:31.831 --> 01:32.798
Come on, Fluffy.

01:32.898 --> 01:33.990
Come on, Mittens.

01:34.100 --> 01:35.068
Come on, Paul.

01:35.502 --> 01:39.494
What a ridiculous name for a cat.

01:39.605 --> 01:42.802
Paul. That's a person's name!

01:42.908 --> 01:44.967
A person's name.

01:47.713 --> 01:48.772
Oh, Paul.

01:51.917 --> 01:53.578
Oh, man, this is gonna be great.

01:53.719 --> 01:55.050
Oh, are we watching a movie?

01:55.254 --> 01:56.380
<i>The lab results are back.</i>

01:56.622 --> 01:58.954
<i>You've tested positive for nymphomania.</i>

01:59.091 --> 02:00.854
<i>Oh, no! What should I do?</i>

02:01.027 --> 02:03.553
<i>Take two of these
and call us in the morning.</i>

02:04.930 --> 02:07.023
Well, now that's not going to help
her nymphomania,

02:07.133 --> 02:08.930
it's only going to exacerbate it.

02:09.769 --> 02:11.361
Oh, my God, what are you kids doing?

02:11.470 --> 02:12.994
Out! Everybody out!

02:13.105 --> 02:15.539
Oh!
Oh! That's bogus.

02:15.975 --> 02:17.273
Chris, what is this?

02:17.377 --> 02:18.809
<i>Genital Hospital.</i>

02:18.944 --> 02:21.606
Yes, and it's inappropriate
for someone your age.

02:21.747 --> 02:24.716
Now, if you're curious about sex,
you should talk to your Sex Ed teacher.

02:24.850 --> 02:25.908
We don't have one.

02:26.018 --> 02:28.486
The principal cut Sex Ed class
to save money.

02:28.654 --> 02:30.884
What? Well, that's crazy!

02:30.990 --> 02:34.118
Without Sex Ed,
kids can wind up sexually confused.

02:34.226 --> 02:35.989
Just look at Michael Jackson.

02:36.095 --> 02:38.029
The kid in me likes the frosted side.

02:38.564 --> 02:40.691
But the grown-up in me
likes the kid in me.

02:42.001 --> 02:44.936
Peter, do you know they're not teaching
Sex Ed at Chris' school?

02:45.304 --> 02:47.101
Let him figure it out the way I had to,

02:47.206 --> 02:49.231
with a can of Crisco and a shot glass.

02:49.375 --> 02:52.071
That's the natural way, Lois.
That's the natural way.

02:52.211 --> 02:53.940
Well, somebody's got to step in.

02:54.046 --> 02:55.877
Tomorrow,
I'm going down to James Woods High

02:55.981 --> 02:57.777
and offer to teach the class myself.

02:57.882 --> 02:59.441
Hey, you could really make a difference.

02:59.618 --> 03:02.280
Like I did when I taught
money management to those drug addicts.

03:02.421 --> 03:04.286
There's a lot of ways for you guys
to save money.

03:04.457 --> 03:07.324
For example, you're all shooting up.
Why not share needles?

03:07.426 --> 03:08.415
That's a no-brainer.

03:08.527 --> 03:10.721
More money in your wallet,
more drugs in your veins.

03:11.129 --> 03:12.562
My second piece of advice,

03:12.664 --> 03:14.292
have as many kids as you can,

03:14.667 --> 03:17.135
'cause that makes it more likely
that one of those kids will grow up

03:17.236 --> 03:19.704
and make it big in Hollywood.

03:20.172 --> 03:21.833
Then who's paying the bills, huh?

03:22.507 --> 03:23.940
Hollywood kid.

03:24.509 --> 03:25.498
Class dismissed.

03:29.115 --> 03:30.480
Good morning, everyone!

03:30.749 --> 03:33.582
I'm Mrs. Griffin, your new Sex Ed teacher.

03:33.719 --> 03:35.413
Now, you've probably heard
all those rumors

03:35.520 --> 03:38.080
that condoms make sex less pleasurable.

03:38.256 --> 03:39.484
While that is a fact,

03:39.591 --> 03:41.355
they also make sex safer.

03:41.627 --> 03:42.685
Sorry I'm late, Lois.

03:42.895 --> 03:44.123
Peter, what are you doing here?

03:44.296 --> 03:46.764
Lois, you think I'm going to miss a chance
to share my knowledge

03:46.866 --> 03:50.301
with these fresh, young minds? Forget it.
I've missed too many other opportunities.

03:50.835 --> 03:52.268
- There he is.
- Took you long enough.

03:52.370 --> 03:53.337
Just what we need.

03:53.438 --> 03:55.339
Hey, guys, I'm coming in.

03:55.741 --> 03:56.708
- Oh, no!
- Oh, no!

03:56.809 --> 03:57.935
Oh, God!

03:58.043 --> 04:00.443
Oh, boy!
I am not going to hear the end of this.

04:00.545 --> 04:01.842
- You jackass!
- Now you've done it!

04:01.946 --> 04:02.913
Idiot!

04:03.014 --> 04:06.415
I know I don't fit here,
but I'm just gonna settle right in.

04:06.551 --> 04:07.711
All right, Peter, you can stay,

04:07.819 --> 04:09.879
but remember, this is my class.

04:10.122 --> 04:13.750
Now, there are a number of natural ways
that males and females interact.

04:13.858 --> 04:15.553
That's right! Allow me to demonstrate.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.052
Hey, Rainbow Brite.

04:17.362 --> 04:18.488
Hello, Shakespeare.

04:18.897 --> 04:21.525
I am all done writing plays for the day.

04:21.733 --> 04:23.895
Perhaps we could have sexual intercourse.

04:24.436 --> 04:25.403
Count me in!

04:32.677 --> 04:33.837
I say, look at this.

04:33.945 --> 04:35.742
This toy has small parts.

04:35.980 --> 04:38.381
Why the devil would they include
small parts?

04:38.651 --> 04:40.982
Unless, I'm supposed to eat them.

04:41.085 --> 04:42.347
Of course, it all adds up.

04:44.122 --> 04:46.181
Oh, dear God, I've lost a tooth.

04:46.291 --> 04:47.258
Dude, you're lucky.

04:47.358 --> 04:49.918
If you put that under your pillow,
the tooth fairy'll come

04:50.028 --> 04:51.188
and give you a dollar.

04:51.297 --> 04:52.263
What?

04:52.363 --> 04:54.160
Did you say the tooth fairy comes here?

04:54.265 --> 04:55.232
To our house?

04:55.433 --> 04:57.333
She just breaks in like some hood?

04:57.435 --> 04:59.062
Yeah, she creeps into your house at night

04:59.170 --> 05:00.899
and comes into your room
while you sleep.

05:01.005 --> 05:03.530
- Oh, my God!
- And sometimes, just for the hell of it,

05:03.808 --> 05:07.972
she cuts off a piece of her armpit hair
and places it gently on your tongue.

05:08.213 --> 05:09.805
Oh, God! Oh, God! I got to get out of here!

05:09.914 --> 05:11.006
I got to get out of here!

05:11.115 --> 05:12.742
Stewie, calm down. Get a hold of yourself.

05:12.850 --> 05:14.249
Here, Brian, let me handle this.

05:14.352 --> 05:17.048
Calm down,
everything's gonna be all right.

05:17.155 --> 05:18.553
Chris, you're wanted on the phone.

05:18.655 --> 05:20.886
Everything's gonna be all right.

05:29.234 --> 05:32.168
Hey, Lois, I wanted to get some K-Y jelly
for the class today,

05:32.269 --> 05:34.329
but they were all out, so I got Smucker's.

05:34.439 --> 05:35.929
Peter, I don't know what you think
you're doing,

05:36.040 --> 05:37.667
but you've ruined my Sex Ed class.

05:37.775 --> 05:39.470
There's no way you're coming
with me again.

05:39.577 --> 05:40.976
Fine, but without my advice,

05:41.079 --> 05:43.013
those kids are gonna be as hopeless
as Liam Neeson

05:43.114 --> 05:45.274
when he tries to play
an American cowboy.

05:45.482 --> 05:47.678
But, Montana, when will you be back?

05:47.785 --> 05:49.412
That's none of your concern.

05:49.621 --> 05:51.555
You gotta take care of the offspring.

05:51.756 --> 05:54.088
Gonna take a fortnight at least
to get this herd down

05:54.192 --> 05:56.057
to St. Louis on Mississippi.

05:56.160 --> 05:58.093
This glen's gonna be tough to traverse.

05:58.262 --> 06:01.493
And that river's gotta be
50, 60 meters wide,

06:01.598 --> 06:03.362
and God knows how many fathoms.

06:03.468 --> 06:05.163
To hell with parliamentary procedure.

06:05.303 --> 06:07.032
We've got to wrangle up some cattles.

06:10.274 --> 06:11.605
What is going on here?

06:11.708 --> 06:14.871
We're all protesting the Sex Ed class
that's being taught to our children.

06:14.978 --> 06:17.038
Mrs. Griffin,
I'm sorry to have to tell you this,

06:17.148 --> 06:20.242
but the school board has voted
to cancel your Sex Ed class.

06:20.418 --> 06:23.580
Look, Principal Shepherd,
I know my husband acted inappropriately.

06:23.687 --> 06:25.177
Oh, it's not because of your husband.

06:25.455 --> 06:28.447
It's because you're teaching those kids
about condoms.

06:28.558 --> 06:31.323
What? That's ridiculous.

06:31.596 --> 06:34.826
These students have the right
to information about safe sex.

06:34.931 --> 06:36.922
Well, these parents don't think so.

06:37.100 --> 06:39.330
I'm sorry, Mrs. Griffin, you're fired.

06:39.569 --> 06:41.935
Fired! Oh, no!

06:50.047 --> 06:51.412
I can't believe they fired you.

06:51.515 --> 06:53.506
Can't you go down to the school
and try to reason with them?

06:53.617 --> 06:55.778
No, I'm banned from school property.

06:55.886 --> 06:58.014
The PTA doesn't want me
around their children.

06:58.122 --> 06:59.589
Well, Lois, I think you did the right thing

06:59.691 --> 07:01.988
by trying to inform these kids
about safe sex,

07:02.092 --> 07:04.356
and if the parents don't like it,
that's their loss.

07:04.494 --> 07:08.260
That's the problem, though,
it isn't their loss, it's the kids' loss.

07:08.365 --> 07:10.799
I just hope they're getting
the information they need.

07:12.303 --> 07:14.566
<i>All right, students,
we have a special speaker today</i>

07:14.671 --> 07:16.502
<i>who's going to educate you about sex.</i>

07:16.606 --> 07:19.166
<i>Please welcome
from the First Evangelical Church,</i>

07:19.443 --> 07:22.276
<i>the Reverend Jerry Kirkwood
and the Opal Ring Crusade.</i>

07:22.479 --> 07:25.471
<i>Hey, kids, put your Walkmans down
and listen up,</i>

07:25.782 --> 07:27.807
<i>because we're gonna talk about sex.</i>

07:27.918 --> 07:30.716
<i>Sex? Hang on there, Jerry.</i>

07:31.054 --> 07:33.079
<i>God, what are you doing here?</i>

07:33.190 --> 07:36.557
<i>I was just passing through on my way
to see The Matrix.</i>

07:37.294 --> 07:39.091
- We can relate to that.
- No fake.

07:39.295 --> 07:42.823
<i>Well, God,
I am here to talk to these kids about sex.</i>

07:42.933 --> 07:44.195
<i>Uh-oh.</i>

07:44.301 --> 07:47.702
<i>- And why they shouldn't be having it.
- That is boss.</i>

07:47.804 --> 07:49.669
<i>Hey, you kids like MADtv?</i>

07:49.973 --> 07:52.167
<i>Well, we've got something
almost as good.</i>

07:52.341 --> 07:54.902
<i>Here they are, the Opal Ring Players.</i>

07:55.545 --> 07:58.036
Boy, I sure had fun
at the pizza parlor tonight, Debbie.

07:58.148 --> 08:00.946
Yeah, Matthew,
that pizza pie was delicious.

08:01.084 --> 08:02.745
Hey, watch out, crazy driver.

08:02.853 --> 08:04.945
That joker must have been
from Jefferson High.

08:05.888 --> 08:06.877
They're our rivals.

08:06.989 --> 08:09.356
Well, here we are at the make out point.

08:09.459 --> 08:12.326
<i>- Yeah, you wanna go all the way?
- Freeze!</i>

08:12.562 --> 08:15.429
<i>Now, who can tell me
what Matthew just did wrong?</i>

08:15.532 --> 08:18.762
<i>I mean, besides not running over
that yahoo from Jefferson High.</i>

08:19.568 --> 08:20.592
They're our rivals.

08:20.703 --> 08:23.229
He's wrong because he wants to have sex,
and he's not married.

08:23.340 --> 08:24.364
<i>Bingo!</i>

08:24.474 --> 08:27.500
- Wow, you're pretty smart.
- Thanks. My name's Doug.

08:27.611 --> 08:28.703
I'm Meg.

08:33.482 --> 08:35.609
<i>Now, look, let's rap for a second.</i>

08:35.751 --> 08:38.482
He's sitting informally like us.
Let's hear what he has to say.

08:38.588 --> 08:39.646
Jefferson High is our rival.

08:39.756 --> 08:43.748
<i>Sure, sex is fun, but you can't have it
before you're married.</i>

08:43.893 --> 08:45.554
<i>Even if you use a condom.</i>

08:45.661 --> 08:48.960
<i>Because not only do condoms fail
100 percent of the time,</i>

08:49.064 --> 08:51.158
<i>they're also majorly unsafe.</i>

08:51.268 --> 08:54.897
<i>Hey, you wouldn't put a plastic bag
over your grandmother's head would you?</i>

08:55.005 --> 08:55.994
No.

08:56.106 --> 08:59.040
<i>And that's why we're gonna be
handing out these opal rings.</i>

08:59.141 --> 09:01.109
<i>These rings are a symbol
of your commitment</i>

09:01.210 --> 09:03.440
<i>to refrain from sex until you're married.</i>

09:03.546 --> 09:05.538
<i>So, what do you say?
Who wants to be joyful?</i>

09:05.682 --> 09:07.013
<i>Who wants to be pure?</i>

09:07.250 --> 09:09.444
<i>Who wants to be abstinent?</i>

09:11.620 --> 09:15.750
- Wow, he makes so much sense.
- I know, he's a visionary.

09:15.958 --> 09:18.392
Like Gandhi or Mozart or Picasso.

09:18.661 --> 09:21.028
Ladies and gentlemen, my newest work.

09:21.231 --> 09:23.061
Now, I know this person
looks a little mixed-up,

09:23.165 --> 09:25.861
but watch carefully.
If I move this down here,

09:26.268 --> 09:27.895
and this over here.

09:28.270 --> 09:30.033
And this part here.

09:30.473 --> 09:32.270
Anyone tell who it is yet? No?

09:32.508 --> 09:34.374
Okay, well, what if I move this here,

09:34.877 --> 09:36.276
and this here.

09:36.679 --> 09:38.044
And it's Dianne Wiest.

09:41.417 --> 09:42.577
All right, men, your mission tonight

09:42.685 --> 09:45.483
is to stave off the invading forces
of the tooth fairy.

09:45.588 --> 09:47.181
SpongeBob, you watch the east.

09:47.324 --> 09:48.984
Starscream, you take the west.

09:49.158 --> 09:52.924
And Man-E-Faces, you take center patrol
since you have many faces.

09:57.833 --> 09:59.232
What... What...

09:59.602 --> 10:01.763
Hey, hey, hey, hey, it's okay. It's morning.

10:02.171 --> 10:05.004
Is it? I knew it, I scared her off.

10:05.174 --> 10:06.971
You might wanna check under your pillow.

10:08.544 --> 10:09.511
How did she get in?

10:09.745 --> 10:12.305
She must have been quieter than
Britney Spears' dietician.

10:13.382 --> 10:15.373
Easy on those trans-fats.

10:16.652 --> 10:18.677
Not everything needs gravy.

10:19.889 --> 10:22.881
You know, there're some carrots
down at the other end.

10:24.527 --> 10:27.051
That cheesecake was for everyone.

10:27.462 --> 10:29.294
Her hand was right beneath my pillow.

10:29.398 --> 10:31.491
She could have snapped my neck
if she had a mind to.

10:31.600 --> 10:32.589
Don't worry about it.

10:32.701 --> 10:34.498
I'm sure it will be a while
before you lose another tooth.

10:34.603 --> 10:35.570
I can't wait for that.

10:35.671 --> 10:38.902
I have to lure her back on my terms
and kill her myself.

10:39.207 --> 10:42.335
But to catch a fairy,
I have to think like a fairy.

10:43.111 --> 10:45.979
<i>If you want Brian to say,
'"Well that'll be a stretch, '"</i>

10:46.081 --> 10:47.946
<i>text message FAMGUY1.</i>

10:48.250 --> 10:51.310
<i>If you want Brian to say,
'"I'm not touching that one, '"</i>

10:51.453 --> 10:52.919
<i>text FAMGUY2.</i>

10:53.721 --> 10:56.588
<i>If you want Brian to say, "Arriba,"
and dance around a sombrero,</i>

10:56.691 --> 10:57.659
<i>text FAMGUY3.</i>

10:58.827 --> 10:59.953
<i>Enter now.</i>

11:02.998 --> 11:04.090
<i>Thanks for voting.</i>

11:04.199 --> 11:05.324
Arriba!

11:09.571 --> 11:11.563
<i>We now return
to Laguna Beach.</i>

11:11.774 --> 11:13.036
<i>- Like, right?
- I know.</i>

11:13.142 --> 11:15.235
<i>- Whatever, because...
- I know, right?</i>

11:15.344 --> 11:17.676
<i>Whatever, because, I mean, like,
totally full-out.</i>

11:17.779 --> 11:19.076
<i>- Full-on.
- Right?</i>

11:19.247 --> 11:21.545
I guess it's not easy growing up anywhere.

11:21.683 --> 11:23.742
Hey, Dad! Check out my abstinence ring.

11:23.918 --> 11:25.682
It means I made a pledge not to have sex.

11:25.854 --> 11:27.617
That's crazy! You can't give up sex.

11:27.723 --> 11:28.849
You've got a responsibility.

11:29.258 --> 11:31.953
You see, Meg.
You're what they call a practice girl.

11:32.060 --> 11:34.085
Dad, look at the facts about sex.

11:34.896 --> 11:38.798
"If you have sex, your penis will fall off
and land in another dimension

11:38.900 --> 11:41.995
"populated entirely by dogs
who will eat it. "

11:42.605 --> 11:44.333
Well, that's something I'd like to avoid.

11:44.539 --> 11:45.733
Well, this changes everything.

11:45.873 --> 11:48.137
From now on, I, too, will be abstinent.

11:48.242 --> 11:51.609
I'll be as untouched as the turn signal
in an Asian woman's car.

11:51.946 --> 11:54.472
How much signal I need
to cut across eight lane?

11:54.583 --> 11:58.143
None? I turn now.
Good luck, everybody else.

12:03.791 --> 12:06.351
All right, getting a tooth
to lure that damn fairy back

12:06.461 --> 12:07.450
shouldn't be too difficult.

12:18.606 --> 12:21.097
I'd love to dance, Fred Savage.

12:23.011 --> 12:24.103
Set, hut...

12:27.548 --> 12:29.482
Gosh, Meg, I really wish we could take

12:29.584 --> 12:31.017
our relationship to the next level.

12:31.119 --> 12:32.984
I know. I feel the same way,

12:33.087 --> 12:35.145
but we made a decision to be abstinent.

12:35.255 --> 12:38.555
Of course,
there are ways we can keep our pledge

12:38.793 --> 12:41.694
- and still do other things.
- You're right.

12:41.929 --> 12:43.692
Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

12:46.300 --> 12:47.426
Oh, there it is. I see it.

12:47.669 --> 12:50.297
You know, Roy, I hope you play squash
better than you pass.

12:50.471 --> 12:52.336
Well, we'll find out this Saturday.

12:56.944 --> 13:00.072
All right, Peter,
you ready for role-playing night?

13:00.248 --> 13:04.378
Here comes Grimace,
"You got some burgers I can steal?"

13:04.652 --> 13:06.779
Lois, the Hamburglar steals burgers,

13:06.888 --> 13:09.152
Grimace is Ronald MacDonald's
retarded friend.

13:09.257 --> 13:13.989
Oh, come on,
you love the dirty-talking Grimace. You...

13:14.161 --> 13:16.652
- Peter, what the hell is this?
- My chastity belt.

13:16.863 --> 13:20.027
A chastity belt?
What in God's name is that for?

13:20.134 --> 13:21.328
I'm abstinent, Lois.

13:21.436 --> 13:23.529
It's all in these pamphlets
Meg brought home from school.

13:23.638 --> 13:26.266
Sex turns straight people gay
and turns gays into Mexicans.

13:26.373 --> 13:27.806
Everyone goes down a notch.

13:28.275 --> 13:31.210
This is nonsense.
You can't force abstinence on kids.

13:31.311 --> 13:33.974
Lois, what possible harm
can abstinence do?

13:34.082 --> 13:35.743
Meg Griffin, we need to have a talk.

13:36.951 --> 13:37.918
Mom!

13:38.653 --> 13:41.280
Oh, my God!

13:41.388 --> 13:44.357
You kids were doing it in the ear!

13:44.458 --> 13:45.789
Hey, my sandwich tastes funny.

13:45.892 --> 13:47.053
